    <title>nsin @ sjsu — info</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <p><a href="/drop">← back to the fun part</a></p>

      <h1>nsin @ sjsu 🇺🇸</h1>
      <p>
        the defense tech club at san josé state. we connect students to real
        national-security work — the stuff this valley was originally built on
        (lockheed was in sunnyvale before google existed).
      </p>

      <h2>what we do</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>🫱🏽‍🫲🏼 <b>consulting</b> — student teams paired with defense &amp; intelligence orgs on live problems. this is the flagship. you ship a real deliverable.</li>
        <li>🎙️ <b>speaker series</b> — defense-tech founders, policymakers, intelligence veterans. in the room.</li>
        <li>🛠️ <b>build &amp; compete</b> — prototype sprints + dod challenges. pipeline to the national security hackathon.</li>
        <li>📜 <b>policy &amp; strategy</b> — ai governance, export controls, deterrence. argued across majors.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>faq</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>💰 <b>cost:</b> $0. everything is free.</li>
        <li>🎓 <b>majors:</b> all of them. engineers build, writers argue, everyone ships.</li>
        <li>🧠 <b>experience:</b> none required.</li>
        <li>📅 <b>when:</b> first cohort starts fall 2026. weekly build nights.</li>
        <li>🔐 <b>clearance:</b> not needed. we work on unclassified problems.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>join</h2>
      <p>
        ✍️ <a href={apply} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">apply here</a> — takes five minutes.
      </p>

      <hr />
      <p><small>nsin at san josé state university · washington square since 1857</small></p>
    </main>

